# Line endings that survive a clone on any system: text files normalised,
# binaries left alone. The .blp are the client art, the .png beside them are
# previews for human eyes, both are binary.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.lua text eol=lf
*.toc text eol=lf
*.blp -text
*.png -text
*.mpq -text
